 "note": "Clare College Old Court east range, Trinity Lane face south of the gate tower (session 76; replaces the s3x Mapillary-based 1-storey reading, which saw only the ground floor over the railings). Built by scripts/zone_bespoke_clare.py (pseudo key way/139308028:clare); city_facades.py counts that module's emitted openings against these walls (KPI_WALLS). Layout read from the Commons photos below (layout only; no pixels used; none held out). Three storeys of sash windows in moulded architraves, alternating 3- and 2-light, balustraded parapet, one pedimented dormer per bay. Bay count south of the gate (6) is read from a frontal view whose left edge cuts the range: the southernmost bay is inferred, x positions are approximate.",
